    "body": "### Problem\n\nmatchit flickers the cursor in the command line sometimes. Spam `%` on a parentheses to see it.\n\nThe issue is not present when using the legacy ui\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n`nvim --clean -u repro.lua`\n\n```lua\nrequire(\"vim._core.ui2\").enable()\n```\n\nHit `%` a bunch of times on a parentheses, for example one in the above `init.lua`\n\n### Expected behavior\n\ndoesn't flicker the cursor to the command line\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nv0.13.0-dev-1076+g69e1321731 Build type: RelWithDebInfo LuaJIT 2.1.1784360928\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nn/a\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nlinux mint 22.3\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nghostty 1.3.1\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-ghostty\n\n### Installation\n\nbuild from repo",
